00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:41.391
I love reading and
responding to your comments.

00:09:41.391 --> 00:09:44.285
So please continue filling
up the comments section.

00:09:44.285 --> 00:09:47.060
As you know, I answer them
within the comment section.

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:48.170
I'm very active there.

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:49.830
And I also do this monthly segment

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:51.530
